<title>UK: Lehman unit sets 200 million stg bond.</title>
<headline>Lehman unit sets 200 million stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEHMAN HOLDING PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LEHMAN BROS HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +0.375    PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.682    FULL FEES   0.375</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.682</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-100     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.175     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
